    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Roach Has Arrived!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cockroach!</strong> is an idle desktop game where you can enjoy the following features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cockroaches crawling across your desktop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying gooey sound effects when you click them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple modes: occasional appearance, always-on mode, and the crazy cockroach swarm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Irresistible collectible element: the Legendary Golden Roach!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling Challenge Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy a copy for your friend, too!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Roach Has Arrived!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cockroach!</strong> is an idle desktop game where you can enjoy the following features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cockroaches crawling across your desktop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying gooey sound effects when you click them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple modes: occasional appearance, always-on mode, and the crazy cockroach swarm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Irresistible collectible element: the Legendary Golden Roach!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling Challenge Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy a copy for your friend, too!</p>",
